{
  "info": {
    "name": "FSMS - Feature 16 - Assignment Accept and Reject",
    "description": "Postman collection for Feature 16: Assignment Accept & Reject.\n\nEndpoints:\n- GET /api/v1/assignments (TECHNICIAN sees own only; MANAGER/ADMIN see all, pagination & status filter)\n- GET /api/v1/assignments/:id (TECHNICIAN sees own only; MANAGER/ADMIN see any)\n- POST /api/v1/assignments/:id/accept (TECHNICIAN only, own assignment only, moves Assignment to ACCEPTED, WorkOrder to SCHEDULED, requires active appointment, audits ASSIGNMENT_ACCEPTED, notifies customer)\n- POST /api/v1/assignments/:id/reject (TECHNICIAN only, own assignment only, body rejectionReason required, moves Assignment to REJECTED, appointment to CANCELLED, WorkOrder to AWAITING_ASSIGNMENT, audits ASSIGNMENT_REJECTED with reason, notifies customer and managers/admins)\n\nSetup:\n1. Import this JSON into Postman.\n2. Configure collection variables: baseUrl, technicianEmail/Password, managerEmail/Password, etc.\n3. Run folder '0. Auth + Setup' to obtain auth tokens.\n4. Run folder '1. GET Assignments'.\n5. Run folder '2. Accept Assignment'.\n6. Run folder '3. Reject Assignment'.\n7. Run folder '4. Access Control & Validation'.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000" },
    { "key": "technicianEmail", "value": "technician@example.com" },
    { "key": "technicianPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "otherTechnicianEmail", "value": "other_technician@example.com" },
    { "key": "otherTechnicianPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "managerEmail", "value": "manager@example.com" },
    { "key": "managerPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "customerEmail", "value": "customer@example.com" },
    { "key": "customerPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "technicianToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "otherTechnicianToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "managerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "customerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "assignmentId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth + Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as TECHNICIAN",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Technician login succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('technicianToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{technicianEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{technicianPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as MANAGER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Manager login succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('managerToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{managerEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{managerPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as CUSTOMER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Customer login succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('customerToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{customerEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{customerPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. GET Assignments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /assignments (Technician - own only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('List assignments succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  if (json.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('assignmentId', json.data[0].id);",
                  "  }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{technicianToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "assignments"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /assignments (Status filter - PENDING)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Filtered assignments succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  json.data.forEach(item => {",
                  "    pm.expect(item.status).to.eql('PENDING');",
                  "  });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{technicianToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments?status=PENDING",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "assignments"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "PENDING" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /assignments (Manager - sees all)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Manager sees all assignments', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{managerToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /assignments/:id (Detail)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Assignment detail retrieved', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('assignmentId'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{technicianToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Accept Assignment",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /assignments/:id/accept (Technician - Happy path)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Assignment accepted successfully', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('ACCEPTED');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{technicianToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/accept"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /assignments/:id/accept (Already accepted -> 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Accepting already accepted returns 400', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{technicianToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/accept"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Reject Assignment",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /assignments/:id/reject (Missing rejectionReason -> 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Missing rejectionReason fails with 400', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{technicianToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/reject"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /assignments/:id/reject (Technician - Happy path)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Assignment rejected successfully', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('REJECTED');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.rejectionReason).to.eql('Outside my service area today');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{technicianToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rejectionReason\": \"Outside my service area today\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/reject"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Access Control & Validation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /assignments/:id/accept (Manager role -> 403 Forbidden)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Manager forbidden from accept', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{managerToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/accept"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /assignments/:id/reject (Manager role -> 403 Forbidden)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Manager forbidden from reject', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{managerToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rejectionReason\": \"Should not be allowed\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/reject"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /assignments (Customer role -> 403 Forbidden)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Customer cannot access assignments', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /assignments (Unauthenticated -> 401 Unauthorized)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Unauthenticated fails with 401', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
